{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あけましておめでとうございます！！\n今年もよろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんお正月はいかがお過ごしですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は舞台「ノートルダムの鐘」や映画を見て号泣したり\n初詣や食事に行ったり\n少しゆっくりできました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から稽古再開っ\n切り替えて頑張ります☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2017/01/03/3657696/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅白\n自分たちの曲と\n山内恵介さんの「流転の波止場」バックで踊らせていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「サヨナラの意味」はバラのような衣装で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2017/01/03/3657696/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2017/01/03/3657696/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみさん\n最後の紅白お疲れさま！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2017/01/03/3657696/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も全員でジャンプして年を越したのですが\nななみんと手繋ぎました。\nにひ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後はCDTV"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2017/01/03/3657696/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鏡開きのお酒\n次は飲める〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年も呼んでいただけるよう\nみんなで新たな1年突き進んでいきます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2017年もみなさんとたくさん思い出作れたらいいなぁ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}